动画加载错误,请尝试以下解决方法修复问题:\n	1. 删除游戏根目录`Cache`文件夹\n	2. 删除游戏根目录`mod\0000_core\pet`文件夹#Animation loading error. Please try the following fixes:\n/tab1. Delete the `Cache` folder in the game root directory\n/tab2. Delete the `mod\0000_core\pet` folder in the game root directory:|
当前工作数据属性超模,是否继续工作?\n超模工作可能会导致游戏发生不可预料的错误\n超模工作不影响大部分成就解锁\n可以在设置中开启自动计算自动为工作设置合理数值#The current work's attributes are overpowered. Continue working?\nOverpowered work may cause unexpected errors in the game\nOverpowered work does not affect most achievement unlocks\nYou can enable automatic calculation in the settings to give works reasonable values automatically:|
