LB制作组发售的一款含有萝莉丝的中秋礼盒。\n生产日期:明天，保质期:永久#A Mid-Autumn gift box sold by the LB team, with Lolis inside.\nProduction date: tomorrow. Shelf life: forever:|
冲Q币吗#Shall we top up some Q-coins?:|
 {name}这个人最精了，熬穿了，给自己烧烤的夜宵，说给主人的早饭# {name} is the craftiest: stayed up all night, grilled herself a midnight snack, and called it Master's breakfast:|
1，2,3,4,5,6！可以！#1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6! I did it!:|
1，哎呦。1,2哎呀。#1, ouch. 1, 2, oops.:|
201,202,203,206。。。。数到哪了？#201, 202, 203, 206... Where was I?:|
一嗒嗒二嗒嗒三嗒嗒。#One-tap-tap, two-tap-tap, three-tap-tap.:|
上划不要长，下划是主功。―整体两划间，排列宜适中。#The upper stroke must not be long; the lower one does the work. ― Between the two strokes, keep the spacing balanced.:|
下午运动注意#Be careful exercising in the afternoon:|
中划长启下，横担要分明。一笔揽腰过，不失砥柱用。#The long middle stroke carries the lower part; the crossbar must be clear. One stroke across the waist serves as the pillar.:|
为什么要半夜跳绳？我也不知道。#Why jump rope in the middle of the night? No idea.:|
主人~这个字怎么写啊？~#Master~ how do you write this character?~:|
主人主人，看我个主人写的诗！#Master, master, look at the poem I wrote for you!:|
主人你看我写的好看吗。#Master, look, is my writing pretty?:|
主人你看，我写满一本了哦！#Look, master, I filled a whole notebook!:|
主人先睡把，我修好就睡。#Go to sleep first, master. I'll sleep once it's fixed.:|
主人快看我100连跳！#Master, quick, watch me do 100 jumps in a row!:|
主人有兴趣一起写吗？很简单的~#Master, want to write with me? It's really easy~:|
主人来一起写嘛~~#Come on master, let's write together~~:|
主人来双人跳吧！#Master, let's jump together on one rope!:|
主人看我特技跳！#Master, watch my trick jumps!:|
主人！玩跳大神吗？什么还少一个人？#Master! Want to do a shaman dance? What, we're one person short?:|
主人，一起跳吧！#Master, let's jump together!:|
人字八交叉，叉处空中顶。下部要对准，不要偏西东。#In 人 and 八, the crossing sits at the top center. The lower part must line up, leaning neither east nor west.:|
什么？你要把这张字裱起来？不行！！！#What? You want to frame this page? No way!!!:|
今天目标是！100个！#Today's goal is... 100 jumps!:|
八字下交叉，亦在字正中。如若偏东西，此字不成形。#When 八 crosses at the bottom, it is also in the center. If it leans to one side, the character loses its shape.:|
划斜体不斜，整体要端正。上斜虽明显，立稳是主功。 #Slanted strokes, upright body: the whole must stay balanced. The top may slope visibly, but standing firm is what matters. :|
到了中午，一天之中，是练字的好时候！#Noon, the heart of the day: the perfect time for calligraphy!:|
剑外忽传收蓟北，初闻涕泪满衣裳#Beyond the pass, news comes that the North is retaken; hearing it, my tears soak my clothes:|
午来需练字。#At noon, it's calligraphy time.:|
午间运动！开始！12345678,22345678。。。#Noon exercise! Start! 1-2-3-4-5-6-7-8, 2-2-3-4-5-6-7-8...:|
吃完晚饭要半小时才能运动哦~#After dinner, wait half an hour before exercising~:|
呜呜呜1，呜呜呜呜2，呜呜呜呜呜呜3.#Sob sob 1, sob sob sob 2, sob sob sob sob 3.:|
哎呦！（被绊倒脸着地）#Ouch! (trips and falls flat on her face):|
啊，主人你什么什么都没看见喵！#Ah, master, you didn't see anything at all, meow!:|
夜深人静，万籁俱寂，是练字的好时候！#Deep night, perfect silence: the perfect time for calligraphy!:|
夜深静练字。#Late at night, quiet calligraphy.:|
天已入夜，众生归巢，是练字的好时候！#Night falls, everyone heads home: the perfect time for calligraphy!:|
寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。#Searching, seeking; cold and cheerless; sorrowful, wretched, and forlorn.:|
就若间隔一次元，我心依旧只向君。#Even if a dimension separates us, my heart still turns only to you.:|
左右有竖者，左短宜瘦形。右竖粗又壮，主笔浑圆成。#With a vertical stroke on each side, the left one is short and thin; the right one, thick and strong, is the main stroke, full and round.:|
开始练字！#Calligraphy practice, start!:|
抽刀断水水更流，举杯消愁愁更愁。#Cut the water with a sword, and it flows on all the more; raise a cup to drown your sorrow, and the sorrow only deepens.:|
方字不方正，左右全内行，左阴笔划细，右阳粗笔明。#A square character is not perfectly square: both sides lean inward. Left (yin), a thin stroke; right (yang), a bold, thick stroke.:|
旋转跳跃我闭着眼~#Spinning and jumping with my eyes closed~:|
早上就该做运动喵。#Mornings are for exercise, meow.:|
早上起来，万物皆新，是练字的好时候！#In the morning, everything is new: the perfect time for calligraphy!:|
春风得意马蹄疾，一日看尽长安花#Proud in the spring breeze, my horse gallops fast; in a single day I see every flower of Chang'an:|
晚间也练字。#Calligraphy in the evening too.:|
有字无正笔，划撇偏斜行。偏者要稍正，整体美容生。#Some characters have no straight stroke, everything slants. Straighten the slanted parts a little, and the whole becomes beautiful.:|
有横又有竖，横短要记清。―竖长不得减，撇捺展长风。#With horizontal and vertical strokes, remember: the horizontal is short. ― Never shorten the vertical, and let the sweeping strokes stretch like the wind.:|
本来字端正，横笔斜上行。倘要平或下，反倒减美容。#In an upright character, horizontal strokes rise slightly. Drawing them flat or downward takes away its beauty.:|
来主人我教你，对，先横，然后。。。#Come, master, I'll teach you. Yes, horizontal stroke first, then...:|
深夜扰民喵！#Disturbing the neighbors at night, meow!:|
烧烤不要只肉喵#A barbecue isn't just meat, meow:|
看我一跳通关！#Watch me clear the level in one jump!:|
看我来个跳绳反体两周半！#Watch me do a reverse two-and-a-half somersault on the rope!:|
跳到你身边~#Jumping right to your side~:|
跳起来！#Jump up!:|
跳跃SB。#Jumping like a dummy.:|
跳！#Jump!:|
跳！跳！跳！#Jump! Jump! Jump!:|
蹦蹦跳跳真可爱。#Hopping around is so cute.:|
辰起一练字。#Rise and practice calligraphy.:|
运动完咬汗干了才能洗澡哦~#After exercise, wait until your sweat dries before you shower~:|
运动完记得好好擦汗哦。#Remember to wipe off your sweat after exercising.:|
这玩意该怎么玩？#How do you play with this thing?:|
你在说什么呢仆从，这是这个月的零花钱（掏出一百万）#What are you talking about, servant? Here's this month's pocket money (pulls out a million):|
家人们谁懂啊，有个下头主人，刚刚给我不知道喂了什么药，气抖冷哭，桌宠什么时候才能真正的站起来。#Folks, can you believe it? My cringey master just fed me some mystery pill. I'm shaking with rage. When will desktop pets finally stand up for themselves?:|
